1 0 0 1 101.378 23.2 Tm
(Split each site into three 120\260 sectors \050or six 60\260 sectors\051\056 Directional antennas reduce the number\057strength of dominant co\055channel interferers\073 channels are assigned by sector and reuse plan\056) Tj
T*
ET
BT
1 0 0 1 325.315 23.2 Tm
(Spatial filtering\056 Improves SIR without adding spectrum\073 worth investigating in dense academic and stadium zones\056) Tj
