T*
ET
BT
1 0 0 1 101.378 6 Tm
(A channel controller assigns an available channel based on local load and interference\073 overloaded macro areas are recursively split into microcells\056 Macro layer gives broad coverage\073 micro layer handles hotspots\056) Tj
T*
ET
BT
1 0 0 1 325.315 6 Tm
(Trunking \053 hierarchical spatial reuse\056 Shares idle channels flexibly and follows demand growth\073 higher control and site cost\056) Tj
